<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Alcatel Alsthom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Alcatel Alsthom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating of Alcatel Alsthom Cie Generale d'Electricite' to a strong buy from its prior rating of outperform.</p>
